## Golden: cadenas — longitud, índice, subcadena y comparación.
weave main into int:
    var s as string is "pengu"
    calling print with "{s.len} {s at 0}\n"
    var head as string is s at 1 to 3
    calling print with "{head}\n"
    if s == "pengu":
        calling print with "eq\n"
    return 0
